  "gradeRuleDescribe": {
    "yms_year": 114.0,
    "yms_smester": 1.0,
    "cls_id": "CH06131",
    "sub_id": "97516",
    "scr_dup": "002",
    "tpa_score_new": "<div>In-class participation accounts for 20% of the final grade; Quiz (written)&nbsp;to account for&nbsp;25% of final grade; CDIO presentation to account for 25%; Final presentation to account&nbsp;for 30% of final grade.</div>\n",
    "tpa_score_new_en": " ",
    "course_pol": "No eating while class is in session please.\nDrinking water will always be fine.\nNo attendance will be taken; however, in-class participation will be expected and appreciated.\nA strict leave policy applies for a session in which a test or a presentation has been scheduled.\nLet's keep each other updated in our class LINE group.",
    "course_pol_en": null,
    "course_rem": "1. Please try to keep your mobile phone use to a minimum.\n2. No eating or drinking.\n3. If you need to leave the room early or if you happen to arrive late, please do so and be seated in a discreet way.\n4. Please show respect for your fellow students.\n5. Two assignments to be completed in the form of a team. Details TBA.",
    "course_rem_en": null,
    "ais_meno": "<div><strong>1.&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;誠信是基本的態度與專業價值的宣言，是將學術理想轉化為行動的行為原則以及落實社會責任。<br />\n2.&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;學術誠信最重要的價值觀之一是思想自由流動與尊重他人智慧財產權之間的平衡。</strong></div>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>學生應重視及恪遵智慧財產權。不得在學術活動中給予、使用或接受未經授權的援助。使用圖書館館藏、有版權的教材讀本與影音資料。</li>\n\t<li>恪守誠信，積極出席和參與課堂的學習承諾。</li>\n\t<li>學生在課堂上都應尊重每個人，並且在任何時候都應以負責和禮貌的態度行事。</li>\n</ul>\n\n<div><strong>3.&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;學生有責任做好自己的學習任務，並避免一切形式的學術不誠實行為。</strong></div>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>不作弊：紙筆測驗時，不得交談、窺竊他人試卷或故意便利鄰座竊窺，或有夾帶、抄襲或傳遞資料等情事經發現時，違者該次考試成績以零分計算。並視違者情節，或有替考情事，其舞弊之雙方，將依逢甲大學學生考試辦法、學生獎懲辦法之相關規定處理。</li>\n\t<li>不抄襲：提交原創作品，嚴禁任何形式的抄襲。</li>\n\t<li>不偽造：篡改成績或其他正式文件，如診所就醫證明。</li>\n\t<li>不篡改/不捏造：從實驗中蒐集數據過程，以人為方式創建數據或編造不存在的數據或資料來源，均被視為捏造或篡改</li>\n\t<li>不破壞：破壞他人的藝術品、實驗或設計成果被視為破壞行為。未能為團隊專題做出貢獻，也被視為學術破壞。</li>\n</ul>\n\n<div>以上情況視違者情節，將依逢甲大學學生獎懲辦法等相關規定提送處分。</div>\n\n<div>\n<div>Please just always remember: Academic integrity is king.</div>\n\n<div>Zero tolerance for plagiarism!</div>\n\n<div>Also for&nbsp;any other form of misconduct.</div>\n</div>\n",
    "ais_meno_en": null,
    "ilearn_mk": "N"
  },
